2
00:19:54,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Anne of Green Gables is a family, drama film directed by Kevin Sullivan.

3
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:57,000
At the turn of the century on Prince Edward Island, Matthew Cuthbert and his
sister Marilla decide to take on an orphan boy as help for their farm.

4
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:54,000
But they get an unexpected jolt when they're
mistakenly sent a girl instead: Anne Shirley.

5
00:49:45,000 --> 00:49:51,000
Anne Shirley, played by Megan Follows.

6
00:59:42,000 --> 00:59:48,000
Marilla Cuthbert, played by Colleen Dewhurst.

7
01:09:39,000 --> 01:09:45,000
Matthew Cuthbert, played by Richard Farnsworth.

8
01:19:36,000 --> 01:19:42,000
